00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:14.940
And in specialization it often makes sense
to trade with other countries even when you

00:05:14.940 --> 00:05:20.880
have an absolute advantage in all goods or
in multiple goods, uh, relative to other countries.

00:05:20.880 --> 00:05:25.030
Here's a, like just a super simple example
