00:05:42.280 --> 00:05:48.470
more efficient at making sweet potatoes in
China growing sweet potatoes we would say,

00:05:48.470 --> 00:05:53.120
and at making cars in China, even if the US
has what's called an absolute advantage in

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:59.940
both sweet potato and car production, it can
still make sense to specialize and only make

00:05:59.940 --> 00:06:05.850
one of those and to get the other one from
China, uh, as part of a, a trade policy because

00:06:05.850 --> 00:06:08.960
